     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Lot&#39;s of visualization workshops are coming up -- check them out!<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: <strong class=\"gmail_sendername\" dir=\"auto\">Pamela L Reynolds</strong> <span dir=\"auto\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">plrey...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Wed, Apr 19, 2023 at 9:54 AM<br>Subject: [datascience-announce] [TRAINING] Register now for Data Visualization Workshops @ DataLab<br>To: datascience-announce Sympa List &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">datascienc...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br></div><br><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">There’s still space to register for the upcoming data visualization workshops at\r\n<a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464848095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mRfIp-5eJtDyV_B6HCXU8\">UC Davis DataLab</a>! See links below and attached Spring 2023 flyer.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Upcoming DataLab Trainings &amp; Events</span></b></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li style=\"color:black;margin-top:12.0pt;background:white\">\r\n<span><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">April 20, 10am-12pm -\r\n</span></b></span><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/principles-of-data-visualization-from-perception-to-statistical-graphics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/principles-of-data-visualization-from-perception-to-statistical-graphics/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464848095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0pVa2ZgjkajTM5GkFFb1jI\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Principles of Data\r\n Visualization</span></a> <u></u><u></u></span></b></li><li style=\"color:black;background:white\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">May 2, 2-4pm -\r\n</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/building-web-maps-with-leaflet-maptimedavis-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/building-web-maps-with-leaflet-maptimedavis-2/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464848095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2_GSy-uOzfahSVhgPpb3nG\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Building Web Maps with Leaflet (with #maptimeDavis)</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></li><li style=\"color:black;background:white\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">May 4, 10am-12pm -\r\n</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/intermediate-python-next-level-data-visualization-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/intermediate-python-next-level-data-visualization-2/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464848095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1zh7SWVlTjXRk1h8D9cono\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Intermediate Python: Next-Level Data Visualization</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></li><li style=\"color:black;background:white\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">May 11, 10am-12pm -\r\n</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/intermediate-r-next-level-data-visualization/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/intermediate-r-next-level-data-visualization/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464848095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0b9shjKuajkV1nHuV5EAx2\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Intermediate R: Next-Level Data Visualization</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></li><li style=\"color:black;background:white\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">May 16, 2-4pm -</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/introduction-to-gis-with-qgis-maptimedavis-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/introduction-to-gis-with-qgis-maptimedavis-2/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464848095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1E-PecvgWM5l29Oi3yc_nZ\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"> Introduction\r\n to GIS with QGIS (with #maptimeDavis)</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></li><li style=\"color:black;background:white\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">May 18, 10am-12pm -\r\n</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/network-visualization/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/network-visualization/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464848095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3M3AmeujirPy3ZJid1TsmS\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Network Visualization</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></li><li style=\"color:black;background:white\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">May 25, 10am-12pm -\r\n</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/technologies-for-interactive-and-dynamic-data-visualization/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/technologies-for-interactive-and-dynamic-data-visualization/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464848095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3wzhiKVSPh08IW41LWxFa3\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Technologies for Interactive and Dynamic\r\n Data Visualization</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></li><li style=\"color:black;margin-bottom:12.0pt;background:white\">\r\n<span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">June 1, 10am-12pm -\r\n</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/visualizing-your-research-data-with-virtual-reality/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/visualizing-your-research-data-with-virtual-reality/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464848095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26I0Dy595HJlQBR9oY9zAY\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Visualizing Your Research Data with Virtual Reality</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></li></ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:.25in;background:white\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">See our</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/workshops/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/workshops/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464848095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0w7c4Xwo941ZraMwEBOZyG\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1155cc\"> event\r\n calendar </span></a></span><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">for additional workshops, user group meetups, and past event recordings.</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\">--</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Pamela L. Reynolds, PhD</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Associate Director</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">DataLab: Data Science and Informatics</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">University of California, Davis</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:black\"><a href title=\"mailto:plr...@ucdavis.edu\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">plrey...@ucdavis.edu</span></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/\" title=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464848095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mRfIp-5eJtDyV_B6HCXU8\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">https://datalab.ucdavis.edu</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464848095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mRfIp-5eJtDyV_B6HCXU8\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1155cc;background:white\">The UC Davis DataLab</span></a></span><span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;background:white\"> seeks\r\n to promote academic and research excellence through quality programs, engaged researchers, and an innovative research and learning environment and to meet growing industry and academic need for graduates with data science skills. To that end, the DataLab complements\r\n existing and developing educational programs to facilitate research in data science and provide a niche for students, faculty, and professional researchers seeking to move beyond their individual programs and explore new opportunities. To sign up for our data\r\n science listserv “datascience-announce” or to manage your subscription, see instructions\r\n</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\"><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/mailing-list/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/mailing-list/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464848095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Euhp3gIqnZ1LOsVzJhcED\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1155cc;background:white\">here</span></a></span><span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333;background:white\">.\r\n We can be reached at </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\">